      'Rs. 922.69', 'Rs. 900', 'Rs. 950', 'Rs. 915.20',
      'Quarterly rate = 2.5% = 0.025. Periods = 3. Amount = 12000 * (1.025)^3 = 12000 * 1.076890625 = Rs. 12,922.69. CI = Rs. 922.69.',
