      'The waste pipe removes the tank contents in 60 minutes, so its net emptying rate is 1/60 tank per minute. The two inlets together fill 1/36 + 1/45 = 9/180 = 1/20 tank per minute. Therefore, the waste pipe fills at 1/60 + 1/20 = 1/15 tank per minute. If this is 30 litres per minute, the tank capacity is 30*15 = 450 litres.',
